@using Molinos.Scato.Dominio.Enums
@using Molinos.Scato.Dominio.Seguridad
@using Molinos.Scato.Dominio.Recursos
@using Molinos.Scato.WebMobile.Seguridad

@{
    Layout = null;
}


<ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="myTab" role="tablist">
    <li class="nav-item ms-auto">
        <!-- ml-auto (Bootstrap 4) replaced by ms-auto (Bootstrap 5) for margin start -->
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-soja">Soja</div>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item tagmaterial">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-maiz text-white">Maiz</div>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item tagmaterial">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-naranja text-white">Trigo</div>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item tagmaterial">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-warning text-white">Girasol</div>
    </li>
</ul>

<div class="content">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <!-- Ensure layout and responsiveness by keeping 'container-fluid' -->
        
        <div class="row g-3" data-bind="foreach: CallesFiltradas('@((int)TipoCalle.Calado)')">
            <!-- Added g-3 (Bootstrap 5) to add gutters between columns -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="sinbordetb row">
                    <div class="col sinbordetb">
                        <div class="card-stats sinbordetb">
                            <div class="card-body sinbordetb">
                                <p class="fw-bold mb-0 cart-title sinbordetb">
                                    <h4>
                                        <strong data-bind="text: Nombre">.</strong>
                                        @if (PermisosHelper.Is(PermisosScato.LlamadoDeFilasAutomatico))
                                        {
                                            <label class="switch">
                                                <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: Automatica(), click: LLamadoAutomatico@*, enable: MaterialId() && MaterialId() != '0'*@">
                                                <span data-id="a" class="slider round"></span>
                                            </label>
                                        }
                                    </h4>
                                </p>
                                <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
                                    @if (PermisosHelper.Is(PermisosScato.CambioDeMaterialEnFilas))
                                    {
                                        <div class="col-12" data-bind="foreach: $root.MaterialesGranos()">
                                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                                <!-- Form inputs and labels updated for Bootstrap 5 -->
                                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" data-bind="attr: { id: $parent.Id + '-' + MaterialId, name: 'rcc'+$parent.Id, value: MaterialId}, checked: $parent.MaterialId, enable: !$parent.Automatica(), click: $parent.CambiarModo">
                                                <label class="form-check-label" data-bind="text: MaterialDesc, attr: { for: $parent.Id + '-' + MaterialId }"></label>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <button type="button" style="width: 100%" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm calle" disabled data-bind="visible: Automatica()">
                                            <strong>LLamado automático</strong>
                                        </button>
                                        <button type="button" style="width: 100%" class="btn btn-success btn-sm calle" data-bind="click: LLamarSiguienteCalle, enable: MaterialId() && MaterialId() != '0', visible: !Automatica()">
                                            <strong>LLamar siguiente fila</strong>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Following a similar structure for the next set of rows -->
        <div class="row g-3" data-bind="foreach: $root.MaterialesGranos()">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                <div class="sinbordetb row">
                    <div class="col sinbordetb">
                        <div class="card-stats sinbordetb">
                            <div class="card-body sinbordetb">
                                <p class="fw-bold mb-0 cart-title sinbordetb">
                                    <h4>
                                        <strong data-bind="text: MaterialDesc">.</strong>
                                    </h4>
                                </p>
                                <div class="row card-filas">
                                    <div class="col" data-bind="foreach: $root.CallesLLamadas('@((int)TipoCalle.PreCalado)', '@((int)TipoCalle.ReCalado)', '@((int)TipoCalle.Circular)', MaterialId)">
                                        <div class="text-white card-camion" data-bind="css: { 
                                            'bg-soja': MaterialId() == 4,
                                            'bg-maiz': MaterialId() == 386,
                                            'bg-naranja': MaterialId() == 13,
                                            'bg-warning': MaterialId() == 5,
                                            'bg-vacio' : MaterialId() == null }">
                                            <div class="card-header text-center" style="padding: 0px; height: 18px;">
                                                <strong data-bind="text: (TipoCalle == @((int)TipoCalle.Circular) ? '&copy; ' : '') + Nombre +' (' + CamionesEnCalle() + ')'"></strong>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Modal section (updated) -->
<div id="cambioEstadoModal" class="modal fade" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-body form-horizontal">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <!-- Bootstrap 5: Updated to new 'mb-3' class for spacing -->
                    @Html.Label("Motivo", new { @class = "form-label" })
                    <!-- Updated from 'control-label' to 'form-label' for Bootstrap 5 -->
                    <div class="controls">
                        <!-- TextArea updated with Bootstrap 5 form-control styling -->
                        @Html.TextArea("Motivo", new { id = "motivo", @class = "form-control", style = "width:350px;" })
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span id="error-largo" class="text-danger" style="display:none;">
                    @string.Format(Textos.Error_LargoMensaje, "Motivo", "10")
                </span>
                <!-- Text-danger for Bootstrap 5 text styling -->
            </div>

            <div class="modal-footer">
                <!-- Buttons updated for Bootstrap 5 modal -->
                <button id="dialogo-confirmar-cambio-modo" class="btn btn-success" name="submitAction">Confirmar</button>
                <button id="dialogo-confirmar-cancelar" data-bs-dismiss="modal" class="btn btn-warning">Cancelar</button>
                <!-- 'data-dismiss' updated to 'data-bs-dismiss' for Bootstrap 5 modal closing -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
